# MT7925 Issue Report: MLO Authentication/Key Setup Failures
# Date: 2026-01-19 08:45 - 09:10 PST
# Kernel: 6.18.6-2-cachyos (CachyOS)
# Hardware: Framework Laptop 16 (AMD Ryzen AI 300 Series)
# DKMS: mt76-mt7925/1.1.0 with patches applied

## Summary

Repeated MLO (Multi-Link Operation) authentication and key setup failures on
WiFi 7 network causing connection instability. Multiple MCU command timeouts
(primarily ROC - Remain On Channel) triggering firmware resets. Issue occurs
during MLO link establishment and Fast Transition (802.11r) roaming.

Single-link WiFi 7 (EHT without MLO) works correctly on same hardware/AP.

## Symptoms

1. Repeated disconnections and reconnections on MLO-capable network
2. MCU command timeouts (ROC, BAND_CONFIG, SCAN_REQ)
3. Firmware resets every few minutes
4. wpa_supplicant errors about MLO key handling
5. Fast Transition (FT/802.11r) failures

